<title>USA: Mercantile Stores June same-store sales up.</title>
<headline>Mercantile Stores June same-store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>FAIRFIELD, Ohio 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mercantile Stores Co Inc said Thursday its same-store sales for the five weeks ended July 5 rose 1.1 percent.</p>
<p>Total sales rose four percent to $252.1 million from $242.3 million.</p>
<p>Year-to-date, comparable store sales rose 1.6 percent. Total sales gained 4.6 percent to $1.13 billion from $1.08 billion.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
